{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Holy water.</b> That was consecrated in the Basin, because it was made from the mirrors of the multitudes [of women], and she departed from their ways — for they would lie with their husbands in Egypt beneath the apple tree, and this one corrupted herself with another — let her be tested by it." "<b>In an earthen vessel.</b> She would give the adulteress choice wine in choice goblets; therefore she shall drink the bitter waters in a despised earthen measuring-cup (Sotah 9)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:30.518113675Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}